=== stand-downs ===
maestro_standdown_total is ABSENT from both nodes above. That is correct,
not a gap: StandDownReason has exactly three values -- UNKNOWN_EVENT_TYPE,
UNKNOWN_EVENT_PAYLOAD, STALE_RUN -- all pathological (unreadable history
from a newer build, or an append colliding with a concurrent runner).
Ordinary two-node traffic and cross-node signalling do not raise any of
them, so Micrometer never registers the counter. The dashboard panel
carries a vector(0) companion series so it renders a flat zero.
